## Visual Elements Summary
The APM may contain the following embedded visual elements:
1. Strategic/governance framework diagrams
2. Organisational charts (leadership team structures)
3. Company group structure diagrams (with colour-coded keys)

---

## Document Formatting Notes
- Document uses Roman numeral section numbering (I, II, III, IV, V, VI)
- Sub-areas within scope use number + letter convention (e.g., 1a, 1b, 2a)
- Tables use bordered grid format
- Figures are numbered sequentially (Figure 1, Figure 2, Figure 3)
- Appendices are lettered (Appendix A, Appendix B, etc.)
